8:def test_drive_recover_flag_is_gone(tmp_path: Path) -> None:\ntests/test_drive.py:1069:    \"\"\"R2 retires `attavo drive --recover`: recovery is what a pass does\ntests/test_drive.py:1073:    add_drive_stall_bound(root)\ntests/test_drive.py:1079:    run = run_attavo(root, \"drive\", \"--recover\", \"1\")\ntests/test_drive.py:1081:    assert \"--recover is gone\" in run.stderr\ntests/test_drive.py:1085:def test_drive_forge_poll_defaults_are_a_real_forges_clock() -> None:\ntests/test_drive.py:1090:    after a record push stop on 'forge checks not green', with a person\ntests/test_drive.py:1091:    running it again after CI: exactly the transport act this lane\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-4cYJH2sZ' (errno=Operation not permitted)\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-3j7FQybk' (errno=Operation not permitted)\na79a154 attavo: spec-gate record for item 217\n attest/records/217/spec-01.json | 34 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 1 file changed, 34 insertions(+)\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-UgFEhNNK' (errno=Operation not permitted)\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-hAa8F19z' (errno=Operation not permitted)\ncommit a79a154df63cab2e827c3097df2e13b67989f501\nAuthor:     attavo-records[bot] <325738051+attavo-records[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nAuthorDate: Fri Sep 25 18:03:23 2026 +0000\nCommit:     attavo-records[bot] <325738051+attavo-records[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCommitDate: Fri Sep 25 18:03:23 2026 +0000\n\n    attavo: spec-gate record for item 2