{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"findings\":[{\"title\":\"Lease rollback discards unrelated working-tree changes\",\"specimen\":\"attavo/drive.py:481\",\"retires\":\"Closes the unsafe implementation of “resets its own marker commit”; rollback must remove only the losing marker commit without destroying operator work.\",\"rejection_test\":\"test_losing_a_marker_push_preserves_unrelated_tracked_and_untracked_working_tree_changes\",\"severity\":\"Blocking when a lease push loses or is refused while the checkout contains unrelated tracked modifications: `git reset --hard HEAD^` deletes those modifications.\"},{\"title\":\"An uncommitted passing stage record can be treated as completed\",\"specimen\":\"attavo/report.py:226\",\"retires\":\"Closes the gap in the required worker-held-copy state: every written-but-uncommitted build or verify record must read as running, or as a refusal after its heartbeat becomes stale.\",\"rejection_test\":\"test_report_reads_an_uncommitted_passing_build_or_verify_as_running_then_refused_when_its_heartbeat_stales\",\"severity\":\"Blocking when the uncommitted record has status `pass`: `drive_state` advances past that stage before `_uncommitted` checks it, allowing a review to start or the item to read ready before the worker commits and pushes the record.\"},{\"title\":\"Recovery cannot construct a valid verify record\",\"specimen\":\"attavo/drive.py:561\",\"retires\":\"Closes recovery for dead or hung review workers, rather than only build workers.\",\"rejection_test\":\"test_a_pass_recovers_a_dead_verify_invocation_with_the_current_build_binding\",\"severity\":\"Blocking when `owes-recovery` names a verify invocation: the generated record leaves required non-null `build_sha` and `build_record` fields unset, so schema validation refuses the recovery instead of writing and pushing `verify-NN.json`.\"},{\"title\":\"A stage starts without a pushed lease when origin is absent\",\"specimen\":\"attavo/drive.py:468\",\"retires\":\"Closes the origin-less exception to the rule that only a successfully pushed marker authorizes a worker to start.\",\"rejection_test\":\"test_drive_without_an_origin_refuses_and_starts_no_worker\",\"severity\":\"Blocking when the checkout has no `origin`: the marker is committed locally and a worker starts even though no marker was pushed, so another checkout has no lease fact preventing the same attempt from running.\"},{\"title\":\"Pre-pass synchronization rebases local commits instead of only fast-forwarding\",\"specimen\":\"attavo/drive.py:315\",\"retires\":\"Closes divergence from the approved requirement that a pass fast-forward its working copy to the origin branch before reading.\",\"rejection_test\":\"test_drive_refuses_or_leaves_the_checkout_unchanged_when_origin_cannot_be_fast_forwarded\",\"severity\":\"Blocking when both the local branch and origin have advanced: the pass rewrites local commits with `git rebase FETCH_HEAD`, changing operator-authored commit identities before taking its lease.\"},{\"title\":\"The worker entry point does not require the lease marker it claims to execute\",\"specimen\":\"attavo/drive.py:431\",\"retires\":\"Closes the bypass around the marker-push lease by requiring a worker invocation to correspond to an existing committed marker for the same stage and attempt.\",\"rejection_test\":\"test_worker_refuses_without_a_matching_committed_invocation_marker\",\"severity\":\"Blocking when `attavo worker N <stage> NN` is invoked directly or with a mismatched attempt: it runs the stage without proving that this process owns a pushed marker, permitting duplicate or unleased execution.\"}],\"tests_named\":[\"test_losing_a_marker_push_preserves_unrelated_tracked_and_untracked_working_tree_changes\",\"test_report_reads_an_uncommitted_passing_build_or_verify_as_running_then_refused_when_its_heartbeat_stales\",\"test_a_pass_recovers_a_dead_verify_invocation_with_the_current_build_binding\",\"test_drive_without_an_origin_refuses_and_starts_no_worker\",\"test_drive_refuses_or_leaves_the_checkout_unchanged_when_origin_cannot_be_fast_forwarded\",\"test_worker_refuses_without_a_matching_committed_invocation_marker\"]}"}}
